				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-10633259/among-the-stars-track-0#post-4184799</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 14 Mar 2019 20:52:10 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Stallmantic</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3472766</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Well I do plan on writing more songs, just for funsies. The rough production is partially stylistic and partially “I had 4 hours to write and record this”. Also I want to do some higher production songs for different tales and SCPs eventually, if I’m inspired and all that.</p> <p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">5/8 is my favorite time signature, don’t even tempt me.</span></p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
